  "name": "Old-Fashioned Pink Lemonade",
  "recipe_type": "drink",
  "brief_description": "Pink lemonade is made with fresh lemon juice, sugar, water, and cranberry juice for a pretty pink drink that's sure to be a hit all summer long!",
